  "pin_bound": "macro-pin bound, not area (R-CAP-2 note): 37 macros 115.8k um2 block M1-M4 under an M5 cap; every SRAM face carries ~410 M4 pins, so each 4-stack face (1.65k pins) keeps a >= 48 um channel and every column is split into a S and a N stack around a 100-um macro-free centre band (xg5fa structure). 648.0 x 518.4: std ~31k um2 over 220k um2 free = 0.14"
 },
 "structural_change": "HARD-S81-DSDV-1 11-13 (R-CAP-3 point 3, COORD ruling): ot_s81sl_xs4 (x streamer of ot_s81sl_xgt_xo, 172,755 synthesized cells + all 37 ROM/SRAM macros) becomes ONE hard core shared by the 16 dsdv_slice_*_C types; RTL unchanged (0 cycles; inputs capture-registered, outputs leave flops). Outline 648.0 x 518.4, ONE pin face (N, M5, 0.144 pitch), macro map = xg5fa column order (b1 | b0 | ROM | ROM | b2), 4-stacks S and N of a 100-um centre band, g_d slices over their banks.",
